# Pairs with SplitRequiresData. The split intent accepts an empty donor.
MODULE: SplitCanStartEmpty
TARGET: SplitRequiresData
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a split enters progress without any acknowledged key
PERTURBS: SplitIntent

--- FIND
    /\ \E k \in Keys : k \in donorRows /\ k \in Moving
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: start an empty split.
    /\ TRUE
--- END
